1
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,940
How is she doing this?

2
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,533
We captured her thundercloud, didn't we?

3
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,840
Kachow, kachow!

4
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:20,360
You naughty boy!

5
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:24,328
Nobody treats me like that and
gets away with it, understand?

6
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,820
Listen, you miserable rodent!

7
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,737
You're gonna be punished for
dropping me into the sea!

8
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,940
and it won't be pretty.

9
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,760
But now, we prepare for the worst.

10
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,720
That old bag sure has a lot of energy.

11
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,520
She looks even stronger now.

12
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,800
Ma, ma, ma, ma!

13
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,780
This is no good.

14
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,560
We need time.

15
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,540
Let's retreat!

16
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,100
Running away?

17
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:56,977
Well, that just won't do.

18
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,500
You knew it! Hey, you!

19
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,759
Why don't you show me what you got?

20
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:03,960
Yes, Mama.

21
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:14,530
Bulbara!

22
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:31,260
Let's go.

23
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:52,237
See you

24
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:56,960
next time.

25
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,420
Hey, killer.

26
00:03:08,420 --> 00:03:09,420
You okay?

27
00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:13,170
Yeah.

28
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,480
Old bat.

29
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:16,780
She sent us flying a long way.

30
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,200
Felt like it.

31
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:22,060
But that aside, where the hell are we?

32
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,340
In the castle.

33
00:03:23,540 --> 00:03:24,716
That's all I've got.

34
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:28,440
And where's Big Mom?

35
00:03:28,820 --> 00:03:30,240
Must have lost us.

36
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,440
That hole she made is pretty huge.

37
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:36,148
She knows we're in here, but
she probably doesn't know where.

38
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:59,740
Little brat, get over here kid,

39
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:05,140
I won't be happy until I split you in two!

40
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:13,044
Sounds like she's below
us, down a floor or two.

41
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:15,220
We gotta try to keep her here.

42
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:18,362
If she teams up with Kaido
again, we're all dead.

43
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,814
I'll send her to hell.

44
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,600
Let's finish this!

45
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:34,620
Straw sword!

46
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:36,810
Huh?

47
00:04:36,893 --> 00:04:37,723
It can't be!

48
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,190
Hawkins!

49
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:49,140
You traitor!

50
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:54,995
You've got some balls showing
your face in front of us!

51
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:57,097
You think I won't kill you?!

52
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,560
I was betrayed by Apu as well.

53
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,213
We aren't so different.

54
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:06,726
I merely avoided a fight that I
knew I had no chance of winning

55
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:13,017
Well aren't you clever But you need a spy
to make it off this stage You're so weak

56
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,877
you knew you'd lose before the fight even

57
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:18,380
started Then get your
ass off the battlefield

58
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,340
Cause some of us are here to win

59
00:05:24,140 --> 00:05:30,297
You can't win You're lucky to still
be alive Shut your damn trap I'm

60
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:34,321
going to throw up just breathing
the same air as a coward like you.

61
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,920
Kid, I'll handle this.

62
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:47,020
We can't leave Big Mom unchecked.

63
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:48,480
Just go.

64
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,680
I'll cut him down.

65
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,460
Thanks, partner.

66
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,460
Come on!

67
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,960
Don't let him get away!

68
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:10,060
You're too kind.

69
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:13,046
I wouldn't stand a chance
against both of you.

70
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:14,260
Demon face.

71
00:06:23,740 --> 00:06:24,800
Look at you.

72
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,216
Such a hard-working little headliner.

73
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:29,220
Your master must be proud.

74
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:31,260
Maybe they'll give you a treat.

75
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:34,761
Say what you want, but
they'll be your last words.

76
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:38,520
There's a 92 % chance
you'll die here after all.

77
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,100
Poor, poor Hitokiri Kamazon.

78
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:43,537
Fortune-telling, huh?

79
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:45,480
Well, fortune favors the bold.

80
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:50,100
Alright then, killer.

81
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:51,720
Best of luck to you.

82
00:07:04,140 --> 00:07:05,140
Screw that.

83
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:07,960
You can take your luck and stuff it.

84
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:10,280
This win will be mine alone.

85
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:17,360
Are you going to run me around all day?

86
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:19,460
Because I've had enough.

87
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,908
Sorry, but we don't
have room for dinosaurs.

88
00:07:24,020 --> 00:07:24,880
No way!

89
00:07:27,580 --> 00:07:28,557
Let's do this.

90
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:31,500
Hit his weak spot, Seesop! I'm on it!

91
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:34,617
You think we're just gonna give up?

92
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:37,237
We'll keep fighting
even if it's not pretty!

93
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,400
First, the temple!

94
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:40,200
The chin!

95
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:41,980
The edible apple!

96
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:44,500
Damn you!

97
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:45,840
You won't stop!

98
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,100
Neither will we!

99
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,820
The apple!

100
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,400
The nostril too!

101
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,960
Get off already!

102
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,660
Come on, man.

103
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,777
How much more abuse are you going to take?

104
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:03,620
You can't be enjoying this.

105
00:08:07,660 --> 00:08:09,540
Try to stay strong, Kumachi.

106
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:11,646
I'm sure we'll be there soon.

107
00:08:13,980 --> 00:08:17,557
The performance floor stage should
be the perfect spot where Selena

108
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:21,457
and her friends gave a whole ton of
keeping Tang to the other generals.

109
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:24,737
On the stage, I can give all of
them an order at the same time.

110
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:30,660
Then we'll have a bunch of gifters on our
side because then I can finally be useful.

111
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,647
After that, you guys
won't have to protect me

112
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:36,400
because it won't matter if I die.

113
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:40,440
So get me to the stage.

114
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,097
How could you say that, Tama?

115
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:43,010
You're wrong.

116
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:44,640
We're here for you.

117
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:49,021
We won't stop fighting until our
friends and Wano are finally free.

118
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,640
Let's do this together.

119
00:08:53,940 --> 00:08:59,000
You've got a beautiful young lady and
her older friend to protect you. What?

120
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,060
Older than who?

121
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,260
I'm only 19!

122
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,960
It's not that I don't want to fight.

123
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:09,040
I want to help people just like me. Oh!

124
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,617
I'm trying, but I...

125
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:13,440
I'm too scared!

126
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:15,940
I can't take it anymore!

127
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:29,293
Making an enemy out of me was
a mistake, you stupid brat!

128
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:32,020
How dare you, break that child!

129
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,620
I'm sorry I yelled, Tama.

130
00:09:38,980 --> 00:09:41,333
You don't need to push yourself anymore.

131
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:44,980
It's time for me to finish this.

132
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:46,280
Do it, Usopp!

133
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:50,420
One lizard buster, coming right up!

134
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:52,920
I'm sick of you!

135
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:57,820
I'm going to pull that stupid nose
off your face and snap it in two!

136
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,320
Special attack green star, go!

137
00:10:05,020 --> 00:10:07,780
Are you just doing this
crap to piss me off?

138
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:09,340
Firework flowers!

139
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:21,257
It's so hot!

140
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:23,200
Careful with that, Usopp!

141
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:26,340
Sorry, it's the best
close-range weapon I've got.

142
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,896
But don't worry, I'll finish him now.

143
00:10:30,540 --> 00:10:31,580
Special attack!

144
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,000
Green Star, go!

145
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,760
Exploding Picoons!

146
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:56,100
Come on, Billy Yusuf!

147
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,260
Bullseye!

148
00:10:57,500 --> 00:10:58,640
Direct hit!

149
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,200
Extermination complete!

150
00:11:03,780 --> 00:11:06,040
You lizards got nothing on me!

151
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:14,100
Hey!

152
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:20,677
I heard that!

153
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:23,560
He got knocked down!

154
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:25,040
But he got up again!

155
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,064
How are we gonna keep him down?

156
00:11:33,060 --> 00:11:33,890
Damn it.

157
00:11:33,973 --> 00:11:36,440
I am gonna kill those idiots!

158
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,980
I wish Kibidongo worked on that, maniac.

159
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,480
It only works with Smilefruits.

160
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,739
But what do we do if he comes back?

161
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,380
Come on, kid!

162
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,500
Where are you?

163
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:56,710
No!

164
00:11:56,793 --> 00:11:58,360
It's Big Mom!

165
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,150
Huh?

166
00:12:07,233 --> 00:12:08,063
Weird.

167
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:09,317
I guess I'm free.

168
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:12,440
Now where's Mama? Mama! I'm here!

169
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:13,660
Where did you go?

170
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:14,930
No!

171
00:12:15,013 --> 00:12:16,400
I'll find you! I'm coming!

172
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,720
Just wait!

173
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:30,960
Mama, please!

174
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,840
Why won't you answer me?

175
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:34,340
I want to help!

176
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:37,960
Did Eustace's power stop working?

177
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:41,300
I finally broke up Kaido and Big Mom.

178
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:45,034
It'll be a pain if she comes
back for that thundercloud.

179
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:52,160
Straw Hat!

180
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:56,000
I'm taking everyone downstairs
while you get Kaido! Okay.

181
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,630
Mama!

182
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:15,420
Having fun, are you?

183
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:22,580
The more dangerous it gets, the
more that smile of yours throws.

184
00:13:54,620 --> 00:13:56,160
Please, Luffy!

185
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:58,020
Defeat him!

186
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,320
End this!

187
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,300
I know!

188
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:26,780
Kiku, does your shoulder hurt?

189
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:30,640
Do not ask such things of a samurai.

190
00:14:31,060 --> 00:14:33,700
It is not but an itch I cannot scratch.

191
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:38,900
Much like the itch upon mine heart
that appeared the day you left home.

192
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:43,610
Izo!

193
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,310
Alright.

194
00:14:48,393 --> 00:14:50,697
If you're well enough to
tease me, that's good news.

195
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,160
But I really am sorry.

196
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:54,811
I shouldn't have left without telling you.

197
00:14:55,400 --> 00:15:00,480
Izo, if the land of Wano is truly opened,
how do you think the country will change?

198
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,110
Can't say.

199
00:15:03,180 --> 00:15:06,780
If we survive, perhaps we'll
discuss it tomorrow morning.

200
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,900
A tall task indeed.

201
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:12,380
The island is engulfed in battle.

202
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:14,140
It's win or die.

203
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:17,246
There must be a shortage
of troops everywhere.

204
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:21,400
I am confident that I can protect
Lord Momonosuke on my own.

205
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:24,500
My opponent will surely be Kanjuro.

206
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:28,557
With any luck, I will reach Lord
Momonosuke before he finds him.

207
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:31,280
This time, Kanjuro will meet his end.

208
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:34,138
The rest of you, go help the others.

209
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:37,240
Godspeed. All right. Fare thee well.

210
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:41,620
Dear friends, let us hope that
we are all reunited soon. Yeah.

211
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:43,250
Come on.

212
00:15:43,333 --> 00:15:44,660
Time's a-wasting. Right.

213
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,200
Good luck.

214
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:52,100
Master Keen!

215
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,760
This is my fault.

216
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:55,980
Allow me to fight Kanjuro again.

217
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,440
I won't fail.

218
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:01,410
Kiku!

219
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:04,240
Let us make haste. Of course.

220
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:08,510
Goodness!

221
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:09,850
Huh?

222
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,900
Greetings, Master Cat Viper!

223
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:13,620
I knew it was you!

224
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:16,660
Cecilion! Baratie!

225
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,420
Where are you dashing off to?

226
00:16:21,780 --> 00:16:22,937
Never mind that, sir.

227
00:16:23,020 --> 00:16:24,373
We could use some help.

228
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,100
The thing is... Pedro!

229
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:37,757
Ah, Pedro was dead?

230
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:38,860
Surely not.

231
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:42,580
Yes, he died fighting
in Big Mom's territory.

232
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:45,606
He sacrificed himself
to protect Luffy's crew.

233
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:48,269
They wouldn't be here
if it wasn't for him.

234
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:52,340
Well, Pedro, good job.

235
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:55,060
It seems Ugarra died a hero.

236
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:58,417
And the bastard responsible
for his death is here?

237
00:16:58,500 --> 00:16:59,380
Uh-huh.

238
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:02,365
It would be bananas if
we let him get off easy.

239
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,814
He's quite formidable.

240
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:06,900
Wanda and Carrot are fighting him now.

241
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,880
We'll give a good thrashing for Pedro.

242
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:21,380
Where are you going? Master!

243
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:27,140
The cat's flying!

244
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:29,590
RACO!

245
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:40,240
Both of you, once I'm gone,
watch out for the Marys.

246
00:17:40,420 --> 00:17:45,240
They're roaming around Onigashima,
doing recon for Kaido and his men. What?

247
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:46,250
They're here?

248
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:47,222
Where are they?

249
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:50,500
Don't worry, I made this! Huh?

250
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:52,250
It's you!

251
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:53,670
Seriously?

252
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:55,680
It's a perfect likeness!

253
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,237
A perfect decoy!

254
00:17:57,320 --> 00:18:00,320
You're the target, but
they're looking for us both.

255
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:03,797
As long as they think we're
together, they'll come after me!

256
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:04,710
Brilliant!

257
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:09,597
Sounds like you're sick of this tiny room
and you're looking for an excuse to fight.

258
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:10,960
It's fine, Yamato.

259
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:14,699
Master King can protect us
and he's on his way here.

260
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:17,520
For now, Lord Momonosuke can count on me.

261
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:19,960
See you soon.

262
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,041
You've got this.

263
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:26,940
Oh, wait.

264
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,680
Hey, Momonosuke.

265
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:31,707
You said you could hear
Luffy's voice, right?

266
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,900
How is he?

267
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:37,457
It seems he's alright.

268
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:39,277
It hasn't changed from earlier.

269
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:41,480
He's not using his full strength.

270
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:44,010
Wait.

271
00:18:44,093 --> 00:18:45,460
I'm hearing a second voice!

272
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:54,117
I'm sure that's Kaido.

273
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:57,200
If Luffy's fighting him
alone, this could get ugly.

274
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,560
I must hurry!

275
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:09,560
Everything's here.

276
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:12,351
All the details of my father's adventures.

277
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:16,460
I've heard tales of his
exploits many times over.

278
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:19,920
But to actually read his words…

279
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:36,220
Well, I'll be the cat burglar
and the long-nosed fool.

280
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:41,660
She's gonna do us!

281
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:44,460
Did Straw Hat bring the whole new crew?

282
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,000
Hi, Elaine!

283
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,200
Oh, Otama!

284
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:56,277
I'm so happy to see you.

285
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:58,700
But this place is very dangerous.

286
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:01,216
Why in the world would you come here?

287
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:04,277
I've been worried about you
since we split up, Olie.

288
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:06,595
You just disappeared back in New Dawn.

289
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,597
Oh, I...

290
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,400
I'm sorry, dear.

291
00:20:11,620 --> 00:20:15,797
It's a scary world for a little girl,
and I've been worried about you, too.

292
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,400
Don't worry, I'm not mad.

293
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:19,582
I'm just happy to see you again.

294
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:22,720
I never got to thank you properly.

295
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:25,217
You took care of me when I lost my memory.

296
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,240
Woo-hoo!

297
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:28,177
That means you got it back!

298
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:29,260
That's wonderful!

299
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:30,630
Uh-huh.

300
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:33,717
Oh, no.

301
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:35,440
Mama went into mother mode.

302
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:38,740
This happens every time
since around kids under 10.

303
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:41,170
Whoa!

304
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:42,880
Let's be careful, Otama!

305
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:45,177
I think they're friends somehow!

306
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:47,440
That kimono looks great on you!

307
00:20:47,620 --> 00:20:48,460
You think so?

308
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:50,600
See my hair head?

309
00:20:50,840 --> 00:20:51,840
It's cute, too!

310
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:55,040
Oshiriko, make her go away!

311
00:20:56,060 --> 00:20:59,040
Say, that woman who did my hair before.

312
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:02,760
Uh, she was a real busybody.

313
00:21:03,020 --> 00:21:04,660
Lived in Okobore town.

314
00:21:04,900 --> 00:21:06,400
Seemed really poor.

315
00:21:07,740 --> 00:21:09,080
Oh, Tsuru, right?

316
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,220
How's she doing these days?

317
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:17,520
I'll never forget my first taste
of Oshiriko that lovely day.

318
00:21:17,940 --> 00:21:19,220
It's so yummy!

319
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:21,747
I wish I could eat it again.

320
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,580
Something happened, actually.

321
00:21:25,860 --> 00:21:26,690
Huh?

322
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:29,060
Teokobore Town, I mean.

323
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:31,420
It's all gone now.

324
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:33,150
Gone?

325
00:21:33,233 --> 00:21:34,740
What do you mean by that?

326
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:38,660
The people there lied and said
they stole food from Kaido.

327
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:42,489
But it was actually the samurai
who took it before the raid.

328
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:46,097
But Kaido's men didn't think twice.

329
00:21:46,180 --> 00:21:49,280
They burned down the whole town that day!

330
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:53,160
Here, Olin.

331
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,160
Goodness! Heavenly!

332
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,960
They're rebels!

333
00:22:05,460 --> 00:22:07,040
Don't let them get away!

334
00:22:07,780 --> 00:22:10,080
Burn them along with the town!

335
00:22:12,820 --> 00:22:15,900
Not just the houses, but people too.

336
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,470
Otsuru.

337
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:20,920
You look gorgeous, Olin.

338
00:22:21,120 --> 00:22:22,532
You're going to love it.

339
00:22:22,660 --> 00:22:23,700
I can't wait!

340
00:22:24,180 --> 00:22:25,420
It's so cute!

341
00:22:27,820 --> 00:22:29,640
Kaido's men killed them!

342
00:22:29,940 --> 00:22:31,580
Don't let them get away!

343
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:35,020
Burn them along with the town!

344
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:51,260
We were strangers But they cared
for me When I lost my memory

345
00:22:53,220 --> 00:22:54,720
Bye, O 'Nein

346
00:23:00,300 --> 00:23:02,200
Those poor people

347
00:23:03,620 --> 00:23:09,000
They had so little In Hokobori
town But they shared with me anyway

348
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:14,740
And you rewarded them with death?

349
00:23:16,380 --> 00:23:19,220
I totally forgot about the lizard guy!

350
00:23:20,100 --> 00:23:21,040
Buzz off!

351
00:23:21,420 --> 00:23:22,780
We're busy now!

352
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,900
Komachiyo, let's go, boy!

353
00:23:25,180 --> 00:23:26,320
Hey, big boss!

354
00:23:26,940 --> 00:23:30,180
Don't let those little
cowards get past you!

355
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:34,120
Let's run!

356
00:23:34,360 --> 00:23:35,320
Must go faster!

357
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:42,020
Too slow!

358
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:44,220
Time to say goodbye!

359
00:23:52,340 --> 00:23:54,640
You spineless coon.

360
00:23:59,080 --> 00:24:03,240
We pirates live in a world
of villainy and vice,

361
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:06,420
but we still have honor and justice.

362
00:24:18,380 --> 00:24:19,740
Damn you!

363
00:24:21,180 --> 00:24:22,620
You bastard!

364
00:24:24,100 --> 00:24:24,940
Oh, bitch!

365
00:24:30,280 --> 00:24:31,520
That was her!

366
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:32,780
It has to be!

367
00:24:33,820 --> 00:24:34,920
It's Mama!

368
00:24:35,260 --> 00:24:37,240
I'm so happy she saved him!

369
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,960
Are you okay, Goma Gio?

370
00:24:41,140 --> 00:24:42,540
We gotta keep going!

371
00:25:10,260 --> 00:25:11,540
Thank you.
